// Grid-adaptive certification (anytime over a doubling look schedule)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/**
 * Doubling look schedule n0, 2*n0, ... capped at the stratum size, sized so
 * the final look can certify a zero-flip stratum at alpha.
